      "id": "claim_47190d063e1d4ce8af54996c1c880b4b",
      "statement": "For a PR branch Open SWE created, the GitHub PR-comment webhook recovers the original agent thread id with thread_id_from_branch (a UUID scan of the branch name) and only falls back to pr_comment_thread_id when the branch carries no embedded id.",
