      "statement": "The default multitask_strategy='interrupt' halts an active run with its sync checkpoint preserved and runs the new message with thread history, while background follow-ups can opt into enqueue; webhook triggers no longer need an in-process busy lock, although dashboard injection retains a Store queue.",
